MID_LGV_XXX_Ism_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Ism_Closed_m01_001: （好像沒必要去那邊。）
MID_LGV_XXX_Kai_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Kai_Closed_m01_001: 好像沒必要去那邊吧。
MID_LGV_XXX_Dit_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Dit_Closed_m01_001: ……不是那邊。\n要做的事……應該就在這裡。
MID_LGV_XXX_Seo_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Seo_Closed_m01_001: 應該沒必要去那邊。
MID_LGV_XXX_Led_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Led_Closed_m01_001: 我現在應該去的地方……\n至少不是那邊吧。
