MID_LGV_XXX_JuFasTemple_Closed_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Lock_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Lock_m01_001: 鎖住了，好像打不開。\n但似乎可以從另一側打開……
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Lock_m01_002: 有沒有辦法繞路到另一側去呢……？
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Open_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Open_m01_001: 好，打開了！\n這樣就隨時都能通過了。
